#: scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 646da5aecb9655945f347bc01bd00ce5961e941dd39dbd05eb47eea4bd9ececb
#. default-sha256: e7d4492f1bb292e7abe7269500361ba5dab7d7b387ae65798e39611928015a33
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My transgression is that I was unable to completely predict where this path we were "
"traveling led."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La mia trasgressione fu il non essere stata in grado di prevedere dove conducesse quel "
"sentiero."

#: scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c85edaebefbfaa202ebe318e09e2086e1cb2469d305026c7d104c2442a697388
#. default-sha256: c2bb2429312049ed56816aea49218d52bf7c36d14d34a23e84a79acd1852e967
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My hands were full dealing with my immediate day-to-day tasks, ⟪k:1⟫so I could do naught but "
"pray there was happiness waiting in the future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero impegnata nelle mie attività quotidiane, ⟪k:1⟫per cui non potei fare altro che pregare, "
"affinché ci fosse la felicità ad attenderci."

#: scenario:scenario_04CA1AB7_ED67_44C2_99D6_240B21119DA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d56ff8154d5d551bbd9614d141ce420cce60bb71c46368e5080aad17741bb41
