"⟪k:0⟫I haven’t said anything to Mother or Father.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re hiding the truth from them, "
"they still don’t know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ho detto nulla ai miei.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se gli stai nascondendo la verità, loro non ne sono a "
"conoscenza."

