"⟪k:0⟫If you dislike me... ⟪k:1⟫and don’t want to be with me...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫then, ⟪k:4⟫well, ⟪k:5⟫"
"I’ll just have to live with that.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As much as it may hurt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se non ti piaccio... ⟪k:1⟫e se non vuoi stare con me...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫beh, ⟪k:4⟫allora, ⟪k:5⟫me "
"ne farò una ragione...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫per quanto possa farmi male."

#: scenario:scenario_7C6DEF28_E8A6_437D_AFC2_352EF04D81D8
