msgctxt "scenario:scenario_150CD807_4299_47CA_B84C_6623A7E6D0C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared so fragile, so precarious looking down on him that it seemed as though, if a "
"gust of wind were to whisk through the room, it would blow her away completely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Appariva così fragile, così instabile mentre lo guardava dall’alto,⟪k:1⟫che se una raffica "
"di vento avesse attraversato la stanza, l’avrebbe spazzata via completamente."

#: scenario:scenario_2AC24185_B847_4C08_854B_01126C59DF24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd74bb23b89610efb58612b93425240c189aec4c0c465e408ca72249a5df957d
