msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father and I were always on the move, traveling across the land by foot, so it was only "
"recently that we heard rumors of Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mio padre ed io eravamo sempre in movimento, attraversando la terra a piedi, per cui siamo "
"venuti a conoscenza delle voci sulla villa solo di recente."

#: scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6579e50496cf9fd6d23ea5c8b4cf84649e54f0ecad633b6cc7fc904be17918ab
