msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0428C509_3AD5_41EF_A5FB_CC73F0B3390B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So after living in one place for long enough,⟪k:1⟫unsettling rumors would begin to spread, "
"forcing us to leave."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perciò, se avessimo vissuto in un posto per troppo tempo,⟪k:1⟫avrebbero cominciato a "
"diffondersi voci inquietanti sul mio conto, costringendoci ad andarcene."

#: scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d579e276ccd9b11fd07429e9ddc92a77a46c4ae4fdb6ed1615e9100f0dc3e62
#. default-sha256: 55ae99dfca0b6744734c8f7cbf0acf29f8c5648f33ebdf6499772b8a9e232a0d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Another reason... ⟪k:1⟫was my father’s line of work.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He painted pictures for a "
"living."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un altro motivo... ⟪k:1⟫era il mestiere di mio padre.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dipingeva quadri per vivere."

#: scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad22f83269b3efc240735997c3153cf72c23318c3d39c71fbb45690a977a57f3
#. default-sha256: 14ea32de3619d2306e247859b1c7a1638fb5e66230cfad8c34c3b75e3b52a9b5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had trouble finding a patron, so he had to work day-to-day...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When he was no "
"longer able to find work in a city, we would move."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma aveva difficoltà a trovare un mecenate, quindi doveva lavorare giorno per giorno...⟪k:1⟫ "
"Quando non era più in grado di trovare lavoro in una città, ci spostavamo."

#: scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7504ee9852e4bdd02eda9a900b7459f15ad7d0101fdb8c6075bd61895dceb3e2
