msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4A09487B_5B8F_4949_B006_58FCF7D98D50"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When we arrived at this town, my father was exhausted and weak.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is when we "
"learned of Rose Manor..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando siamo arrivati in questa città, mio padre era esausto e debole.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ed è stato "
"allora che siamo venuti a conoscenza della Villa delle Rose..."

#: scenario:scenario_3019C590_EF86_450D_A610_9FC45A26E841
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06f152375380067a347e7b54fca11b485bf7108da195605fc33eb7a35fb4a3eb
