msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5E3FFC92_40C2_4D6A_B331_110CB044A00F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having failed the Rhodes family, no one else would become his patron.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Just as a "
"good reputation spreads, so too does a bad one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avendo fallito con la famiglia Rhodes, nessun altro sarebbe diventato⟪k:1⟫il suo protettore."
"⟪k:2⟫ Proprio come si diffonde la buona reputazione,⟪k:3⟫lo stesso vale per quella cattiva."

#: scenario:scenario_257ABE1B_D6AA_4061_8DE2_36D66AAF79EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a3a5b46426aaf242f032372e73e1bfc80c1dad61e9fc65a414297ba95d0ef36
#. default-sha256: 221a4d61c4d6102b6b0df1011a568afa3a0d31b36a123a1ef37fc080dc3a28f7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_257ABE1B_D6AA_4061_8DE2_36D66AAF79EB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Branded once as a failure, no one will take you in ever again!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You nobles throw "
"your parties and spread your gossip about this painter or that sculptor!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fallisci una volta, e nessuno ti coinvolgerà mai più!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Voi nobili date le vostre "
"feste e diffondete i vostri pettegolezzi su questo pittore o su quello scultore!"

#: scenario:scenario_1872A2B1_B2F1_4FED_92D5_77B5C6235A02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
