msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario:scenario_4C79A825_BC8B_4501_A0B5_2BA0E88A8755
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fd2395bb75ede6716928057c732edb37a95bf46ec20c86d303e77c73a8471cc
#. default-sha256: bce7999e952c001d5e8a94e7094aa0093a2e08b1c088501281efd7c74abf8435
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4C79A825_BC8B_4501_A0B5_2BA0E88A8755"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The rose you tried to give me is an example of that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was certainly crafted with "
"skill, but the jeweler is only known because some aristocrat spoke highly of him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La rosa che hai provato a darmi ne è un esempio.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sicuramente è stata creata con "
"abilità, ma il gioielliere è noto solo perché c’erano aristocratici che ne parlavano bene."

#: scenario:scenario_6962A1BA_5A83_4624_A0CC_8C6E364D191B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b0fcd43fa902a95354c5594fa41653924a501369bc0d00e21d750dfad81426b
#. default-sha256: a8c927d79261001eb52d8988837e08ed689f8e48209bd3f32ae910251258ec08
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6962A1BA_5A83_4624_A0CC_8C6E364D191B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father’s paintings were no less skillful!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫His was a talent that could not be "
"easily imitated!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I dipinti di mio padre non erano meno validi, al contrario!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il suo era un talento "
"che non poteva essere facilmente eguagliato!"

#: scenario:scenario_915E5451_8083_472C_8693_C47ACEFE7ED5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 021104800a1d47d9f04a4e296b72b01c65c3724eda5b3c9a1fda6556056c73b4
#. default-sha256: 69a659570ec7376df2a53a3330d4256a65ce912593764287012505f87dfc1be3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_915E5451_8083_472C_8693_C47ACEFE7ED5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But no one was willing to separate the art from the artist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma nessuno era disposto a distinguere l’arte dall’artista."

#: scenario:scenario_21810620_3685_4F78_9BCA_832550E29B62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb07433ef90ba896a5f3f4cc0e693dca76427f45a8745f2ca4c92b99652d928e
#. default-sha256: 0f21030644e24450fd17763144741f4744e841194ff2ffe895a4f2b2115bf796
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_21810620_3685_4F78_9BCA_832550E29B62"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Rhodes family stole everything from my father.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But even thrown out onto the "
"streets, his only skill was painting."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La famiglia Rhodes ha rubato ogni cosa da mio padre.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma anche se gettato in mezzo "
"alla strada, la sua unica abilità era dipingere."

#: scenario:scenario_571CF3A2_CEFA_4E6C_B91D_1E24807F6603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77141500fa0789a6ca687dd5cdd5365ec5cd246318172fb1a58ab431ee3e3ade
#. default-sha256: 19326e94b3c61000c10d1ecb490656fdf4033207b3325c148db925832c495963
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_571CF3A2_CEFA_4E6C_B91D_1E24807F6603"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That was all he could do to earn a living."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era tutto ciò che potesse fare per guadagnarsi da vivere."

#: scenario:scenario_31E38DAE_533E_41D5_88DF_D96EA452F213
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 202b933bb579fa590d2741bd0000504022514294eb0f482a3ae414cadadc569b
#. default-sha256: 1e73772edc4ff098b70431710e3d9f5b35bd2976f281b7b20dd97041f966ada8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_31E38DAE_533E_41D5_88DF_D96EA452F213"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What little money we had for food, he gave to me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He did anything he could to "
"ensure my survival,⟪k:3⟫even at the expense of his own well-being."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quel poco cibo che potevamo permetterci, lui lo dava a me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ha fatto tutto il "
"possibile per garantire la mia sopravvivenza,⟪k:3⟫anche a spese del suo stesso benessere."

#: scenario:scenario_E3A8A197_803D_4EBC_8E0F_BD2FC6D493AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8028a0f17974a5d8084fa628886dad378f3868c3185f9fb53ca0a827fac4f7c6
#. default-sha256: 1b495ce8ab0c0e4de1960beba95a3184568639ac2982deb6586d0e1d31e5b290
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E3A8A197_803D_4EBC_8E0F_BD2FC6D493AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...My father passed away in this town."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Mio padre è morto in questa città."

#: scenario:scenario_A06ABDFD_7866_46D3_9E53_D3FFA5ABA2EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aea7f44681e97c7fb8e2fe8f7175398d58f5de0d34a0a0ff192bb9ae5eb2ceb6
#. default-sha256: 0d238d1109c5a095946a5bd7c2ff864568346c30bfaba71195810e4b9c32226f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A06ABDFD_7866_46D3_9E53_D3FFA5ABA2EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Up until his last breath, he was only ever concerned about me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Fino al suo ultimo respiro, la sua unica preoccupazione era prendersi cura di me..."

#: scenario:scenario_CD6E291F_755C_4BE7_B15C_D83003B2EADE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 015f0fd291386bdac65116e87ad247e9c42e304b3a996fe08fa0aaa9477bd6d5
#. default-sha256: 3f6df62e100e734e794e85e3bf0605cc1a4a6d35b5c9b8037904f261757308fa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD6E291F_755C_4BE7_B15C_D83003B2EADE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He held me in his arms and ran his fingers through my hair,⟪k:1⟫an apologetic look on his "
"face."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi teneva tra le sue braccia, passandomi le dita tra i capelli,⟪k:1⟫con lo sguardo affranto."

#: scenario:scenario_725EE1AB_2004_4A1B_89CD_9CF2B86B71A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf97ccc321cf9fbbd8f2038193bab968a8b27a329e403f05d163d8ae6291669e
#. default-sha256: 4b174e08dccc4410e10ff0fc5e44ee51f6ff9e9b2edabb6b526b7570bc9b8cc8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_725EE1AB_2004_4A1B_89CD_9CF2B86B71A4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If I had a normal appearance...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m sure life would have been much easier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se avessi avuto un aspetto normale...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sono sicura che la vita sarebbe stata molto "
"più facile."

#: scenario:scenario_B8E1E342_BE88_4156_A690_13018EBCDAAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d001e8cde8679ec91ee12020dc10d1533e9fade9210ea39651b321cb723e738a
#. default-sha256: b27a9abd5780ad5c60316be48d7dafd55a6b4da17c49cee8c51ae8ed90a211dc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B8E1E342_BE88_4156_A690_13018EBCDAAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was always telling me how sorry he was for making life so hard,⟪k:1⟫even though it’s not "
"his fault I look like this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi diceva sempre quanto fosse dispiaciuto per aver reso la nostra vita così difficile, anche "
"se non era colpa sua."

#: scenario:scenario_153870F0_EAC5_4DA7_8CA6_CA3544CEE0DD
