msgstr "⟪k:0⟫.........⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫.................."

#: scenario:scenario_28853A73_29D4_4A43_BF93_9BA4F07EF93B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e7ecd8ec006f1da96128cdfad9c59499026b751a1435cc24766587f87c9a9f2
#. default-sha256: 2dcd57d514a7e1a7521bc8d5e187b53add34d90f19b79bc2832799292adfb4d3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_28853A73_29D4_4A43_BF93_9BA4F07EF93B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I disdained the Rhodes family for putting us...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, for putting my father through "
"such hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Disprezzavo la famiglia Rhodes per averci messo...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, per aver messo mio padre in "
"una tale difficoltà."

#: scenario:scenario_472740DE_ED88_4671_9470_93460F18559C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a68909ca388a693cfda370b130fba1157ff81cecae6a73b9b8f4c91afdae14bf
#. default-sha256: f8c3bcb336165df21155aa9bfcba72c0f5d544a1f96221bfc4a67ff94231dab2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_472740DE_ED88_4671_9470_93460F18559C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagined you were still living in decadence,⟪k:1⟫acting as though nothing had ever "
"happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ho immaginato che viveste ancora nella vostra intransigenza,⟪k:1⟫comportandovi come se nulla "
"fosse accaduto."

#: scenario:scenario_2E8B6A2C_E63A_40F1_AC64_11E4AF5DCA1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b127a82b2145fc391d2b65ff89ff4fcf1617645836c2049dcf61fb5a6ad07b4
#. default-sha256: 606ecb80b70e67675112f08bef3f77ca0789bd269b92bd12c2d018f5d956a31b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2E8B6A2C_E63A_40F1_AC64_11E4AF5DCA1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫you wouldn’t even care about the fate of one simple painter.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Our "
"lives meant nothing to you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non vi importava nemmeno del destino di un semplice pittore.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le nostre vite non "
"significavano nulla per voi..."

#: scenario:scenario_069495CE_C027_4774_A7EF_20A347FC2145
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db72ecec8d315aaf6cbebfe248f57600be99f306876723bbe0eb7d3ca42929f8
#. default-sha256: 668760f529545c0b3b7a9edf0d4f72b53968beb6c4d0324dbd4ba5c9779b6bf3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_069495CE_C027_4774_A7EF_20A347FC2145"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so, I sought to bring misfortune upon you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così, ho cercato di portare disgrazia su di voi."

#: scenario:scenario_480EC6D3_51C4_47F4_8798_38493C5712CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22286d82662f498ef596f7486f4a7eaec0f0eae2f9b7148273e8382b8f409a10
