msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re right—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if they lost me,⟪k:3⟫it would put my family in a very difficult "
"position."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hai ragione—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫se mi avessero perso,⟪k:3⟫ciò avrebbe messo la mia famiglia in una "
"situazione difficile."

