#: scenario:scenario_CEFAB2C8_09C9_4E80_BFCE_64DCC12B65AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de420e0f996937a52882cc45b6c48a1cfcdd38955202fd831fdc04db88577c92
