msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CEFAB2C8_09C9_4E80_BFCE_64DCC12B65AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is the whole of my tale.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You now know about my father—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and how I feel "
"about you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questa è la mia storia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ora sai di mio padre—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e di cosa provo per voi."

#: scenario:scenario_316ABADC_699D_4B6E_B376_8C83FA905184
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7603a70439b97db0246acba5172662093cf2733dcc380a7a224c9c9cb0eef16c
