msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As you said, you had countless opportunities,⟪k:1⟫but you could not bring yourself to do it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come hai detto, hai avuto innumerevoli occasioni,⟪k:1⟫ma non hai avuto il coraggio di farlo."

