msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I assumed the residents of Rose Manor would be cold,⟪k:1⟫people who believed that wealth and "
"rank mattered above all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ho pensato che i residenti della Villa delle Rose sarebbero stati freddi,⟪k:1⟫persone "
"convinte che la ricchezza e il rango fossero più importanti di qualunque altra cosa."

#: scenario:scenario_96ADFF43_9B89_4340_804B_D4BE556E5EBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42750a9c00ea5695f07cb19a3eb87fc348c83180b95ba04bb689170c07ca1240
#. default-sha256: 7e0a4445b9b7431cca835bf8dc5587862bc039cdeda1de9eab0dac203d23d4ca
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96ADFF43_9B89_4340_804B_D4BE556E5EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But on the night of the storm,⟪k:1⟫the mistress was the first one to extend her hand to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma la notte della tempesta,⟪k:1⟫la padrona è stata la prima a tendermi la mano."

#: scenario:scenario_7B76CFE3_409A_4B9A_814F_084FD1A08324
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea402e3b17c3aba59cf7389d8785a7cd69b77d672ecbf799ffe54f0fdd1ce8b4
#. default-sha256: 3bca021fc4e1eeb279b524cc19da329fe5ad087cfa7221479ff1a9a3a5b1ac43
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B76CFE3_409A_4B9A_814F_084FD1A08324"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I arrived at the mansion disguised as a beggar—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Actually, “disguised” is not the "
"right word, as many nights I only survived on the generosity of others."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono arrivata alla villa camuffata da mendicante—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫no, ⟪k:3⟫in realtà, “camuffata” "
"non è la parola giusta, poiché molte notti sono sopravvissuta soltanto grazie alla generosità "
"degli altri."

#: scenario:scenario_65863436_D2F5_43EB_8207_B6C7C3C0924A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69070f46864e290e6278b3946a614e693f0ede5e5cf684fc21cb1955acffec4e
#. default-sha256: 4b3ad24a93fcfe457ba49218201b5fe0f3193ce210d33425c96489a3459c5a0f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65863436_D2F5_43EB_8207_B6C7C3C0924A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mistress did not send me away when she saw me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quite the opposite—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she "
"took me in as a servant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La padrona non mi ha cacciata via quando mi ha vista;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tutto il contrario—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"mi ha presa come sua servitrice."

#: scenario:scenario_8B3C936B_1D1B_4E2F_AD9A_79A6C8A2D79E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74d972e83dc22cbb7b559db8eb25f84860245693d0c656971a01f734ecf2bf42
#. default-sha256: 451e3dfe1f3c826f6742a894d4bcf9f1da130605ec3130979e3ce1a6079e89d3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8B3C936B_1D1B_4E2F_AD9A_79A6C8A2D79E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So that was Mother’s doing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così è stata mia Madre..."

#: scenario:scenario_EA4815B8_4D8D_4CD4_93DE_13CDC1833F85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37d9ad1d9267d9b95ec6e4789ec550f3121cc43f0872371640161ee02c6f4931
#. default-sha256: 44c329b979709c4cb8ddde25a493e38d748ddfe2938f748b0a65c6c40ad2c0ff
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA4815B8_4D8D_4CD4_93DE_13CDC1833F85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could scarcely believe she would invite a stranger into her home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that she "
"would treat a stranger with such compassion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I thought perhaps she knew who my father "
"was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non riuscivo a credere che avrebbe accolto una sconosciuta a casa sua—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫che avrebbe "
"trattato un’estranea con tanta premura.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pensavo che lei sapesse chi fosse mio padre."

#: scenario:scenario_D56BD33A_0F0F_4EDB_A6D1_3CF0F78C5517
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f14036a9edbf8ba72beaa5e0a6364b697cb2e0500ef56f101d6fa5e94c4d8b27
#. default-sha256: bda7ead53e88dec0cba67a1c18a24a9031db240d7213fbbfdb1d7cedd188ea90
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D56BD33A_0F0F_4EDB_A6D1_3CF0F78C5517"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I had never met any of you before,⟪k:1⟫so she must simply be that kindhearted a woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non avevo mai incontrato nessuno di voi prima,⟪k:1⟫quindi dev’essere semplicemente una "
"donna di buon cuore."

#: scenario:scenario_7A982247_1E84_4602_B391_86DD1D3DB012
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 889f8eb358c97d4fe54b8ce52579a71c342b3fe51c62f69044ec820ac7e8f885
#. default-sha256: 01f3f75c86ce1143319eab70bcd60a3efa5a65d305db0ab74a8170e46b3ddd2e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7A982247_1E84_4602_B391_86DD1D3DB012"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the mistress continued to treat me with kindness,⟪k:1⟫despite my disquieting appearance "
"and the darkness in my heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E ha continuato a trattarmi con gentilezza,⟪k:1⟫nonostante il mio aspetto inquietante e "
"l’oscurità che avevo dentro."

#: scenario:scenario_0EF9F3A5_6B3C_4BF1_8083_D0739100F596
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edfdcb453a549259c4553dd5f6ba531385e4dd0d0ea86e142f12e9241c5d653c
#. default-sha256: 6b2ea8d15019f84a22656d530a9cc00fbb1be33f4f33c791ab41ab2604b41b3b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0EF9F3A5_6B3C_4BF1_8083_D0739100F596"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In time, I began to grow less and less sure of myself.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Was what I meant to do truly "
"right?⟪k:3⟫Were the things I felt truly justified?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Col tempo, ho iniziato a diventare sempre meno sicura di me stessa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era davvero "
"giusto quello che avevo intenzione di fare?⟪k:3⟫Ciò che provavo era davvero giustificato?"

#: scenario:scenario_8E7DA108_6859_4730_A4FF_05F1A6F1C2DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc6fbc837210c80f1ef0d462e8e997bce88ab48dc484a5665fc650da1735fa8f
#. default-sha256: 9abf3f49b68848d7290b1192625cd0533dc9ad92641681b4310d3b609868a782
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8E7DA108_6859_4730_A4FF_05F1A6F1C2DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was a certain fact... ⟪k:1⟫that my father was here,⟪k:2⟫and that he had been chased "
"out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma era un dato di fatto... ⟪k:1⟫che mio padre fosse stato qui,⟪k:2⟫e che fosse stato "
"cacciato."

#: scenario:scenario_49D6498C_B252_4187_8B74_E582162CB7C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a30b506eab68b97b987f74eb406a0f5a4f8c7e971b842e3dccfd90eed1efcfc2
