#: scenario:scenario_86496116_5CBB_4FAF_99B7_4A39E11F1AAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 869b517f2d0e44ccadae5607d39cb4f8ed912747f6784b8d247a430b9d83849f
