msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For several long moments, her lips trembled in trepidation. But in time, she squeezed them "
"together and made a smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per diversi lunghi momenti, le labbra della ragazza tremarono per la trepidazione. Ma poco a "
"poco, formarono un sorriso."

#: scenario:scenario_D3976FA8_1FF1_4B42_B2E7_ABCEB885D513
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
