msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mell mi contattò il giorno dopo."

#: scenario:scenario_A41251B7_9250_4B65_9D8F_30BAC9398177
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d14814b296e18d22e2c0dfac30c2fec1bbc17eabac0557c7ed1326eb42c923c
#. default-sha256: 761c636bfd6fd7113da67b329198307d66b37e7b6f5b754f122333ee47982f7b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A41251B7_9250_4B65_9D8F_30BAC9398177"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He explained to me the course of events, and then asked me to dress her up more beautifully "
"than any other noble girl had ever been."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mi spiegò lo sviluppo degli eventi, e poi mi chiese di vestirla nel modo più bello in cui "
"qualsiasi altra ragazza nobile fosse mai stata."

#: scenario:scenario_B636FE98_E51B_4325_83D6_2944F597A7AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77c54242a3545957fb3ba84883f117db8f668e44f822821ef5fe1f0cef6980c0
#. default-sha256: 61abf69ba78bdf427072f6d7f5456f86ad61e27e7376ee2c564ba66a55408f43
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B636FE98_E51B_4325_83D6_2944F597A7AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was already a very pretty girl, so even without much effort on my part—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫simply "
"putting her in a dress—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she radiated beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era già una ragazza molto carina, perciò non servivano grandi sforzi da parte mia—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"bastò semplicemente vestirla, per far sì che irradiasse bellezza."

#: scenario:scenario_8DC226C8_9DFB_42BA_BCF3_AEA74EE6CE67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87321eb42230fe13ee3cea52649de0209cef7cdd992eaf2117981464dc0ae464
#. default-sha256: 9c9219bf4a13d4167dff0ad91932e3dfb42fd2f047693e8a2c4afa065748c170
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8DC226C8_9DFB_42BA_BCF3_AEA74EE6CE67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was quite partial to her smile, so I agreed to help, thinking that if it would lead to "
"their happiness, I could not ask for anything more."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E inoltre amavo molto il suo sorriso, così accettai di aiutarli,⟪k:1⟫pensando che se ciò li "
"avesse condotti alla felicità, non avrei potuto⟪k:2⟫chiedere di meglio."

#: scenario:scenario_D249464A_BE14_4518_91CF_059F78DC12D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ac4e9065c9df75b0f09d1a71f8c3337226e690a97a809071fa409d822435122
